arable pain, the destruction of Gaza is a symbol of our age. FREE PALESTINE!</p>\n","summary":"","format":"rich_text_editor"},"category":[{"uri":"https://radar.squat.net/api/1.2/taxonomy_term/ff3e2872-6140-4645-98f0-784d656a9c5c","id":"ff3e2872-6140-4645-98f0-784d656a9c5c","resource":"taxonomy_term","name":"music/concert"}],"date_time":[{"value":"1791486000","value2":"1791486000","duration":0,"time_start":"2026-10-08T21:00:00+02:00","time_end":"2026-10-08T21:00:00+02:00","rrule":null}],"image":[],"price":null,"link":[],"offline":[{"uri":"https://radar.squat.net/api/1.2/location/6e36d37f-c50d-4a88-bd29-128d82ae601c","id":"6e36d37f-c50d-4a88-bd29-128d82ae601c","resource":"location","title":"K K\u00f6penicker Stra\u00dfe  Berlin Deutschland"}],"phone":null,"topic":[{"uri":"https://radar.squat.net/api/1.2/taxonomy_term/a5b2ff92-7e15-4bb2-bf36-5a05daea26a5","id":"a5b2ff92-7e15-4bb2-bf36-5a05daea26a5","resource":"taxonomy_term","name":"Anarcho Punk HC Antifascist"}],"title":"Konzert im K (F) Punx for Palestine","language":"de","url":"https://radar.squat.net/en/node/598533","created":"1790679993","uuid":"0ebc3587-a62b-4715-8444-fd9f83162354"},"597926":{"body":{"value":"<p>\"Black Block (Genua 2001)\"<br />Italy, 2011, OmdU R.:D: Carlo Bachschmidt<br /><br />Drawing on the harrowing testimonies of people who witnessed the raid on the Diaz School during the 2001 G8 summit in Genoa, *Black Block* presents a case study of police violence and arbitrary detention that could happen anywhere. Activists Lena, Niels, Chabi, Mina, Dan, Michael, and Muli recount in painful detail how they moved from street protests against the G8 summit to the supposedly safe Diaz School on the outskirts of Genoa, where they intended to spend the night.</p>\n","summary":"","format":"rich_text_editor"},"category":[{"uri":"https://radar.squat.net/api/1.2/taxonomy_term/2a56c4d7-eb98-4f96-9ac6-d383a1af5ce8","id":"2a56c4d7-eb98-4f96-9ac6-d383a1af5ce8","resource":"taxonomy_term","name":"bar/cafe"},{"uri":"h